--[[
	DigitalServices — Compact Client Interface
	------------------------------------------------------------------
	Type:      LocalScript (client-side only). No server script is required.
	Location:  StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts   (inside YOUR OWN place)
	Run:       Roblox Studio > Play (F5), or any experience you own or are
	           explicitly authorised to develop.

	Contents:  Personalised greeting (5 s) · Camlock [X] · ESP [Z]
	           Camera FOV (1-120, default 70) · Shared range (25-1000, default 300)
	           Click a key chip -> "PRESS" -> press a key to rebind (Esc cancels)
	           Show/Hide UI [RightShift] · Unload with full cleanup

	Notes:
	  * Everything here only changes the local player's own camera and local
	    visuals, so no RemoteEvents or server code are needed.
	  * The script does not interact with, or try to bypass, any game's protections.
	  * Roblox renders at most 31 Highlight instances at once; players beyond that
	    still get distance tags.
	  * Settings reset each time the script runs.
]]

